OTT Streaming Platform Churn Analysis
📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes user behavior on an OTT streaming platform to understand why subscribers cancel their subscriptions. The analysis focuses on watch time, subscription plans, genres, engagement levels, and churn patterns.

The goal is to generate business insights and recommend retention strategies that help reduce customer churn and improve user engagement.

📂 Dataset Information

Dataset includes:

User ID
Watch Time
Subscription Type
Genre Watched
Monthly Charges
Cancellation Status

Dataset Source:
Netflix Userbase Dataset

